        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.252,
            0.747,
            0.288
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "1. 本试卷满分为 150 分，全部考试时间总计 180 分钟。\n2. 所有答案必须写在答题纸上，写在试题纸上或草稿纸上一律无效。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.308,
            0.467,
            0.325
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "一、选择题（共40分，每小题1分）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.335,
            0.859,
            0.372
          ],
          "content": "（第 1\\~30 小题，请从 4 个选项中选出 1 个正确答案；第 31\\~40 小题，请从 4 个选项中选出 2 个正确答案）"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.139,
            0.382,
            0.855,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": "1、天冬氨酸的  $pK_{1}(-COOH)=2.09$ ， $pK_{2}(-NH_{3}^{+})=9.82$ ， $pK_{3}(-R)=3.86$ ，其等电点是"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.411,
            0.314,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": "A、 $(\\mathrm{pK}_{1}+\\mathrm{pK}_{2})/2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.411,
            0.65,
            0.428
          ],
          "content": "B、$(\\mathrm{pK}_2 + \\mathrm{pK}_3) / 2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.439,
            0.312,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": "C、 $(\\mathrm{pK}_{1}+\\mathrm{pK}_{3})/2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.51,
            0.439,
            0.694,
            0.456
          ],
          "content": "D、$(\\mathrm{pK}_1 + \\mathrm{pK}_2 + \\mathrm{pK}_3) / 2$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.137,
            0.465,
            0.556,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": "2、对具四级结构的蛋白质进行一级结构分析时"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.493,
            0.588,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": "A、有一个自由的 $\\alpha-NH_{2}$ 和一个自由的 $\\alpha-COOH$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.521,
            0.364,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": "B、只有自由的 $\\alpha-NH_{2}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.495,
            0.522,
            0.71,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": "C、只有自由的α-COOH"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.549,
            0.526,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": "D、有一个以上自由的 $\\alpha-NH_{2}$ 和 $\\alpha-COOH$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.138,
            0.577,
            0.315,
            0.594
          ],
          "content": "3、蛋白质变性在于"
